igh-end retail. Brushed aluminum or stainless steel faces with customizable halo colors. Energy-efficient LED modules with smart dimming capability.\", \"sku\": \"BL-CHL-HL01\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/halo-lit-channel-letters\", \"category\": \"signage-solutions\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_halo-lit-channel-letters.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 500, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/halo-lit-channel-letters\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (LED modules)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"2,000 nits (halo effect)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes Halo-Lit Channel Letters different from traditional channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Halo-Lit Channel Letters feature a reverse-lit design where the LED modules create a diffused glow behind the letters, offering a sophisticated and modern look compared to the direct illumination of traditional channel letters.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What materials are used for the letter faces and how do they affect durability?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The letter faces are made from brushed aluminum or stainless steel, providing a premium finish that is both durable and weather-resistant, suitable for outdoor use with an IP65 rating.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the halo color be customized to match our brand colors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the halo colors are customizable with options including White, Warm white, and RGB, allowing you to select colors that best represent your brand identity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the lifespan of the LED modules used in these channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The energy-efficient LED modules have an expected lifespan of over 60,000 hours, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a dimming feature available for the Halo-Lit Channel Letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the product includes 0-100% smart dimming control, allowing adjustment of brightness to suit different lighting environments and times of day.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does installation and maintenance compare to other LED signage options?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is straightforward with adjustable standoffs (1\\\" to 3\\\") to accommodate various wall depths. Maintenance is minimal due to durable materials and long-lasting LED modules, making it efficient compared to other signage types.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Are these channel letters suitable for outdoor use in harsh weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. The product features an IP65 weather rating, making it highly resistant to dust and water, ideal for outdoor environments in harsh GCC climates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does pricing for Halo-Lit Channel Letters compare to other backlit signage?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"While Halo-Lit Channel Letters may have a higher initial cost due to premium materials and energy-efficient LEDs, their sophisticated appearance and low maintenance provide excellent long-term value for premium brand presence.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Halo-Lit Channel Letters\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/halo-lit-channel-letters\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Halo-Lit Channel Letters</h1><p>Choose Halo-Lit Channel Letters for sophisticated LED signage in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for UAE installations today.</p><p><strong>Sophisticated back-lit glow for premium brand presence.</strong></p><p>Elegant halo-lit (reverse-lit) channel letters creating a stunning glow effect behind each character. The diffused backlight creates a modern, upscale aesthetic perfect for luxury brands, hotels, and high-end retail. Brushed aluminum or stainless steel faces with customizable halo colors. Energy-efficient LED modules with smart dimming capability.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes Halo-Lit Channel Letters different from traditional channel letters?</h3><p>Halo-Lit Channel Letters feature a reverse-lit design where the LED modules create a diffused glow behind the letters, offering a sophisticated and modern look compared to the direct illumination of traditional channel letters.</p><h3>What materials are used for the letter faces and how do they affect durability?</h3><p>The letter faces are made from brushed aluminum or stainless steel, providing a premium finish that is both durable and weather-resistant, suitable for outdoor use with an IP65 rating.</p><h3>Can the halo color be customized to match our brand colors?</h3><p>Yes, the halo colors are customizable with options including White, Warm white, and RGB, allowing you to select colors that best represent your brand identity.</p><h3>What is the lifespan of the LED modules used in these channel letters?</h3><p>The energy-efficient LED modules have an expected lifespan of over 60,000 hours, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"halo-lit-channel-letters\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/halo-lit-channel-letters\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script