65 rating.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan the halo color be customized to match our brand colors?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the halo colors are customizable with options including White, Warm white, and RGB, allowing you to select colors that best represent your brand identity.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is the lifespan of the LED modules used in these channel letters?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe energy-efficient LED modules have an expected lifespan of over 60,000 hours, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Halo-Lit Channel Letters - Elegant LED Signage Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Choose Halo-Lit Channel Letters for sophisticated LED signage in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for UAE installations today.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/halo-lit-channel-letters\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/stat