: \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/halo-lit-channel-letters\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A (LED modules)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"2,000 nits (halo effect)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Tb0a,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes Halo-Lit Channel Letters different from traditional channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Halo-Lit Channel Letters feature a reverse-lit design where the LED modules create a diffused glow behind the letters, offering a sophisticated and modern look compared to the direct illumination of traditional channel letters.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What materials are used for the letter faces and how do they affect durability?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The letter faces are made from brushed aluminum or stainless steel, providing a premium finish that is both durable and weather-resistant, suitable for outdoor use with an IP65 rating.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the halo color be customized to match our brand colors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the halo colors are customizable with options including White, Warm white, and RGB, allowing you to select colors that best represent your brand identity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the lifespan of the LED modules used in these channel letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The energy-efficient LED modules have an expected lifespan of over 60,000 hours, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a dimming feature available for the Halo-Lit Channel Letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the product includes 0-100% smart dimming control, allowing adjustment of brightness to suit different lighting environments and times of day.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does installation and maintenance compare to other LED signage options?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is straightforward with adjustable standoffs (1\\\" to 3\\\") to accommodate various wall depths. Maintenance is minimal due to durable materials and long-lasting LED modules, making it efficient compared to other signage types.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Are these channel letters suitable for outdoor use in harsh weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. The product features an IP65 weather rating, making it highly resistant to dust and water, ideal for outdoor environments in harsh GCC climates.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does pricing for Halo-Lit Channel Letters compare to other backlit signage?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"While Halo-Lit Channel Letters may have a higher initial cost due to premium materials and energy-efficient LEDs, their sophisticated appearance and low maintenance provide excellent long-term value for premium brand presence.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\