12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T685,<h1>Halo-Lit Channel Letters</h1><p>Choose Halo-Lit Channel Letters for sophisticated LED signage in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for UAE installations today.</p><p><strong>Sophisticated back-lit glow for premium brand presence.</strong></p><p>Elegant halo-lit (reverse-lit) channel letters creating a stunning glow effect behind each character. The diffused backlight creates a modern, upscale aesthetic perfect for luxury brands, hotels, and high-end retail. Brushed aluminum or stainless steel faces with customizable halo colors. Energy-efficient LED modules with smart dimming capability.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes Halo-Lit Channel Letters different from traditional channel letters?</h3><p>Halo-Lit Channel Letters feature a reverse-lit design where the LED modules create a diffused glow behind the letters, offering a sophisticated and modern look compared to the direct illumination of traditional channel letters.</p><h3>What materials are used for the letter faces and how do they affect durability?</h3><p>The letter faces are made from brushed aluminum or stainless steel, providing a premium finish that is both durable and weather-resistant, suitable for outdoor use with an IP65 rating.</p><h3>Can the halo color be customized to match our brand colors?</h3><p>Yes, the halo colors are customizable with options including White, Warm white, and RGB, allowing you to select colors that best represent your brand identity.</p><h3>What is the lifespan of the LED modules used in these channel letters?</h3><p>The energy-efficient LED modules have an expected lifespan of over 60,000 hours, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Halo-Lit Channel Letters - Elegant LED Signage Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Choose Halo-Lit Channel Letters for sophisticated LED signage in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for UAE installations today.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/halo-lit-channel-letters\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/halo-lit-channel-letters\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"Viewp