s are made from brushed aluminum or stainless steel, providing a premium finish that is both durable and weather-resistant, suitable for outdoor use with an IP65 rating.</p><h3>Can the halo color be customized to match our brand colors?</h3><p>Yes, the halo colors are customizable with options including White, Warm white, and RGB, allowing you to select colors that best represent your brand identity.</p><h3>What is the lifespan of the LED modules used in these channel letters?</h3><p>The energy-efficient LED modules have an expected lifespan of over 60,000 hours, ensuring long-term reliability and reduced maintenance costs.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Halo-Lit Channel Letters - Elegant LED Signage Dubai UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Choose Halo-Lit Channel Letters for sophisticated LED signage in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx for UAE installations today.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/halo-lit-channel-letters\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T627,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"Halo-Lit Channel Letters\", \"description\": \"Elegant halo-lit (reverse-lit) channel letters creating a stunning glow effect behind each character. The diffused backlight creates a modern, upscale aesthetic perfect for luxury brands, hotels, and high-end retail. Brushed aluminum or stainless steel faces with customizable halo colors. Energy-efficient LED modules with smart dimming capability.\", \"sku\": \"BL-CHL-HL01\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://